on" | "TLife App | Shop : Checkout : Order Confirmation".\nPage URL (c3) = www.t-mobile.com/checkout/finish or es.t-mobile.com/checkout/finish.\nPage URL (v6) = www.t-mobile.com/shop/checkout/confirmation or es.t-mobile.com/shop/checkout/confirmation.\nAND Flow Name (v154) = activation intent via [sdi] Activation Intent: "ACTIVATION Intent" | "DEFERRED Intent" | "Prospect Activation Intent" | "Activacion de prospecto Intent".\n[sdi] Postpaid (Exclude HSI BYOD Orders) - HSI: Site = TLife App or TMO AND Flow = ACTIVATION/Prospect Activation Intent AND Product Type = ISP AND Orders exists.\nBYOD SIM: confirmation page with Orders AND Product Name = "BYOS SIM or eSIM", "SIM Card", "Tarjeta SIM", "Mobile Internet SIM Card", or "Tarjeta SIM para Internet movil" AND Flow = activation intent.\nRemoves HITS where OS = Google Android AND Order ID (v14) does not exist AND Page Layout State (v86) = Native App.\nOrders Unassisted - Postpaid Flow / UPV Postpaid Flow. Sums with Orders Unassisted - HSI Flow + Orders Unassisted - BYOD Flow = Orders (Unassisted) total.' AS apx_build_details,'HSI AND BYOD ORDERS\nIN-STORE/SCREEN-SHARE\nPROSPECT FILTERS\nANDROID GHOST HITS' AS apx_excl_labels,'Excludes HSI and BYOD orders from Postpaid count.\nIn-store and screen-share sessions excluded via Unassisted Proxy.\nAll prospect filters applied.\nAndroid native app ghost hits (missing Order ID) excluded.' AS apx_excl_details,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_glossary_category
