ospecto Intent, Prospect Activation, Activation Intent).\nRemoves HITS where OS = Google Android AND Order ID (v14) does not exist AND Page Layout State = Native App.\nOrders Assisted BYOD Flow / UPV BYOD Flow. Part of Orders (Assisted) total.' AS apx_build_details,'SCOPE\nANDROID GHOST HITS\nASSISTED REQUIREMENT' AS apx_excl_labels,'Scoped to SIM/eSIM product names with activation intent.\nAndroid ghost hit exclusion applied.\nREQUIRES assisted proxy signal - unassisted sessions excluded.' AS apx_excl_details,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_glossary_category
UNION ALL SELECT 54 AS apx_sort_order,'orders_overall' AS apx_id,'Orders (Overall)' AS apx_label,'Metric' AS apx_record_type,'Bottom Funnel' AS apx_funnel_stage,3 AS apx_funnel_sort,'Orders' AS apx_category,54 AS apx_category_sort,'Postpaid + HSI + BYOD' AS apx_scope,'All' AS apx_lob,FALSE AS apx_is_subflow,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_parent_id,TRUE AS apx_subflows_summable,'Adobe Analytics -> Databricks (adobeFunnel pipeline)' AS apx_source_system,'Databricks' AS apx_source_platform,'prdrzranalytics.lab42.sdi_tbl_adobeFunnel_gold_flowPerformanceByChannelGroups_weekly' AS apx_source_table,'Improvado' AS apx_data_owner,'Daily at 7 AM PST' AS apx_refresh_cadence,'Total orders completed across all channels - self-serve (Unassisted) and employee-assisted (Assisted) combined - the complete digital order volume regardless of assistance level.' AS apx_definition,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_sum_warning,'orders_overall' AS apx_cvr_numerator_id,'UPV_actuals_overall' AS apx_cvr_denominator_id,'SOURCE ARCHITECTURE\nDERIVED TOTAL\nBASE METRIC\nCVR %\nREFRESH' AS apx_build_labels,'prdrzranalytics.lab42.sdi_tbl_adobeFunnel_gold_flowPerformanceByChannelGroups_weekly consolidates the individually migrated/ported Adobe funnel tables for each metric into one Gold table, so all Adobe funnel metrics live in a single place.\nOrders (Overall) = Orders (Unassisted) + Orders (Assisted). Flows CAN be summed - Unassisted and Assisted are mutually exclusive by definition (every order is exactly one or the other).\nOrders confirmed on a recognized order confirmation page, with universal + prospect qualifiers and Android ghost-hit exclusion applied - the same base population that Unassisted and Assisted split via the [DA] Unassisted/Assisted Proxy segments, with neither proxy filter applied here. This composition is inferred from how those two segments are documented as complementary (same signals, one includes them and one excludes them) -- not independently confirmed as its own named Adobe segment, so flag it if that assumption turns out wrong.\nOrders (Overall) / UPV Actuals.\nDaily at 7 AM PST.' AS apx_build_details,'PROSPECT FILTERS\nANDROID GHOST HITS' AS apx_excl_labels,'All prospect filters applied (same as Orders (Unassisted) and Orders (Assisted)).\nAndroid native app ghost order hits (no Order ID) excluded, same as both Unassisted and Assisted flows.' AS apx_excl_details,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_glossary_category
