utes several, so this does not compare like-for-like with the visit-level UPV and cart metrics.\nNOT the QGP "Eligibility Check" metric - different source, different definition.' AS apx_excl_details,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_glossary_category
UNION ALL SELECT 51 AS apx_sort_order,'digital_pct_phone_new_accounts_total' AS apx_id,'Digital % of Phone New Account Activations - Total' AS apx_label,'Metric' AS apx_record_type,'Bottom Funnel' AS apx_funnel_stage,3 AS apx_funnel_sort,'New BANs' AS apx_category,51 AS apx_category_sort,'Consumer Postpaid - Phone, New Accounts' AS apx_scope,'Postpaid' AS apx_lob,FALSE AS apx_is_subflow,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_parent_id,FALSE AS apx_subflows_summable,'Quarterly Game Plan (QGP)' AS apx_source_system,'Databricks' AS apx_source_platform,'prdrzranalytics.lab42.sdi_tbl_qgparchive_gold_curated_weekly' AS apx_source_table,'Preeti Laharwani / Bharat Kavuru' AS apx_data_owner,'Daily at 9 AM PT' AS apx_refresh_cadence,'The share of all new Consumer Postpaid phone accounts activated through digital - self-serve and rep-assisted combined. The headline digital-penetration number, and the only one of the three carrying a QGP target.' AS apx_definition,'A ratio: do not sum across weeks. Equals No Assistance % + Assistance % exactly - both share this denominator.' AS apx_sum_warning,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_cvr_numerator_id,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_cvr_denominator_id,'SOURCE\nNUMERATOR\nDENOMINATOR\nCOMPONENTS\nACT VS QGP %\nREFRESH' AS apx_build_labels,'QGP operational data - no Adobe segment filtering. The ratio arrives pre-calculated from QGP; Tableau only sums it.\nDigital new-account phone activations, No Assistance + Assistance, TM1-mapped.\nAll Consumer Postpaid new-account phone activations, every sales channel, excluding National Retail Indirect (~145.9K, WE 8/15/26).\nEquals No Assistance % + Assistance % exactly - both share this denominator.\n(Actuals minus Target) / Target. Future weeks carry an Outlook equal to the Target.\nDaily at 9 AM PT.' AS apx_build_details,'DENOMINATOR SCOPE\nMETRIC SCOPE\nRATIO' AS apx_excl_labels,'Denominator excludes National Retail Indirect.\nNew-account phone activations only - excludes AALs, upgrades, BTS, Broadband, Fiber.\nA ratio: do not sum across weeks.' AS apx_excl_details,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_glossary_category
UNION ALL SELECT 52 AS apx_sort_order,'digital_pct_phone_new_accounts_no_assistance' AS apx_id,'Digital % of Phone New Account Activations - No Assistance' AS apx_label,'Metric' AS apx_record_type,'Bottom Funnel' AS apx_funnel_stage,3 AS apx_funnel_sort,'New BANs' AS apx_category,52 AS apx_category_sort,'Consumer Postpaid - Phone, New Accounts' AS apx_scope,'Postpaid' AS apx_lob,FALSE AS apx_is_subflow,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_parent_id,FALSE AS apx_subflows_summable,'Quarterly Game Plan (QGP)' AS apx_source_system,'Databricks' AS apx_source_platform,'prdrzranalytics.lab42.sdi_tbl_qgparchive_gold_curated_weekly' AS apx_source_table,'Preeti Laharwani / Bharat Kavuru' AS apx_data_owner,'Daily at 9 AM PT' AS apx_refresh_cadence,'The share of new Consumer Postpaid phone accounts customers activated digitally.' AS apx_definition,'No QGP target or Outlook - actuals only. Blank on future weeks.' AS apx_sum_warning,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_cvr_numerator_id,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_cvr_denominator_id,'SOURCE\nNUMERATOR\nDENOMINATOR\nEXAMPLE\nTARGET\nREFRESH' AS apx_build_labels,'QGP operational data - no Adobe segment filtering. The ratio arrives pre-calculated from QGP; Tableau only sums it.\nConsumerPostpaidNewPhoneBANActivationsTM1MappedDigital - new-account phone activations with no rep involvement. Splits into BOPIS + Non-BOPIS (4,304 + 11,002 = 15,306, WE 8/15/26).\nSame as the Total row (~145.9K).\nWE 8/15/26: 15,306 / 145,900 = 10.5%.\nNo QGP target or Outlook - actuals only.\nDaily at 9 AM PT.' AS apx_build_details,'BOPIS TREATMENT\nMETRIC SCOPE\nFUTURE WEEKS' AS apx_excl_labels,'BOPIS counts as No Assistance here - the opposite of how Adobe''s [DA] Unassisted Proxy treats in-store signals in the Orders rows.\nNew-account phone activations only.\nBlank on future weeks.' AS apx_excl_details,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_glossary_category
UNION ALL SELECT 53 AS apx_sort_order,'digital_pct_phone_new_accounts_assistance' AS apx_id,'Digital % of Phone New Account Activations - Assistance' AS apx_label,'Metric' AS apx_record_type,'Bottom Funnel' AS apx_funnel_stage,3 AS apx_funnel_sort,'New BANs' AS apx_category,53 AS apx_category_sort,'Consumer Postpaid - Phone, New Accounts' AS apx_scope,'Postpaid' AS apx_lob,FALSE AS apx_is_subflow,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_parent_id,FALSE AS apx_subflows_summable,'Quarterly Game Plan (QGP)' AS apx_source_system,'Databricks' AS apx_source_platform,'prdrzranalytics.lab42.sdi_tbl_qgparchive_gold_curated_weekly' AS apx_source_table,'Preeti Laharwani / Bharat Kavuru' AS apx_data_owner,'Daily at 9 AM PT' AS apx_refresh_cadence,'The share of new Consumer Postpaid phone accounts activated in digital with a rep assisting.' AS apx_definition,'No QGP target or Outlook - actuals only. Blank on future weeks.' AS apx_sum_warning,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_cvr_numerator_id,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_cvr_denominator_id,'SOURCE\nNUMERATOR\nDENOMINATOR\nEXAMPLE\nTARGET\nREFRESH' AS apx_build_labels,'QGP operational data - no Adobe segment filtering. The ratio arrives pre-calculated from QGP; Tableau only sums it.\nConsumerPostpaidNewPhoneBANAssistedActivationsTM1MappedDigital - new-account phone activations transacted in digital with rep assistance, TM1-mapped (45,332, WE 8/15/26).\nSame as the Total row (~145.9K).\nWE 8/15/26: 45,332 / 145,900 = 31.1%.\nNo QGP target or Outlook - actuals only.\nDaily at 9 AM PT.' AS apx_build_details,'NOT ADOBE ORDERS\nMETRIC SCOPE\nFUTURE WEEKS' AS apx_excl_labels,'Counts activations, not Adobe orders - will not reconcile to Orders (Assisted).\nNew-account phone activations only.\nBlank on future weeks.' AS apx_excl_details,CAST(NULL AS STRING) AS apx_glossary_category
